          "guid": "mtiyg3ustyn731it",
          "message": {
            "text": "Automation identity must override both TTY detection and explicit browser opt-in. Pueue inherits the Hot Sheet desktop terminal, so TTY alone can misclassify an agent-started SVG Scrubber or Demo Review server as interactive; CODEXCI and HOTSHEETDRIVESPAWNED are durable inherited sentinels at the final shared opener boundary. The compiled dist copy was rebuilt after this change, and src/cli/common.test.ts covers both sentinels even with DOMOTIONOPEN_BROWSER=1.",
            "markdown": "Automation identity must override both TTY detection and explicit browser opt-in. Pueue inherits the Hot Sheet desktop terminal, so TTY alone can misclassify an agent-started SVG Scrubber or Demo Review server as interactive; CODEX_CI and HOTSHEET_DRIVE_SPAWNED are durable inherited sentinels at the final shared opener boundary. The compiled dist copy was rebuilt after this change, and src/cli/common.test.ts covers both sentinels even with DOMOTION_OPEN_BROWSER=1."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/cli/common.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 78,
                  "endLine": 85,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  if (\n    env.VITEST != null\n    || env.DOMOTION_NO_OPEN === \"1\"\n    || env.CI != null\n    || env.CODEX_CI != null\n    || env.HOTSHEET_DRIVE_SPAWNED != null\n  ) return false;\n  return interactive || env.DOMOTION_OPEN_BROWSER === \"1\";"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
